  "description": "Cache recovery component for CoreSystem.Cache on .NET 8 that restores\n\t\t\ttracked memory fallback entries to the primary cache provider after recovery.",
  "id": "CoreSystem.Cache.Rehydration",
  "isPrerelease": false,
